{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a8c3e1d0-4b2f-4e91-9c11-spot-backend-2026",
    "name": "SPOT Backend",
    "description": "Import **collection** + environment `SPOT Backend Local`.\n\n**Thứ tự test tay**\n1. `0. Randomize test accounts`\n2. Auth Host: Register → Role → Verify OTP → Login → PATCH skills → PATCH avatar\n3. Auth Joiner: tương tự\n4. Host: Create kèo (có `coverUrl`) — script lưu `matchId`\n5. `GET /matches` — xem `coverUrl`, `host`, `isFavorited`, `participantAvatars`\n6. Joiner: Join → Favorite → GET detail (`hostPhoneNumber` nếu AUTO/ACCEPTED)\n\n`OTP_DEBUG=true` thì Register tự điền OTP.\n\nLogin Host → `{{hostToken}}`. Login Joiner → `{{joinerToken}}`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const start = new Date(Date.now() + 7 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000);",
          "start.setMinutes(0, 0, 0);",
          "const end = new Date(start.getTime() + 2 * 60 * 60 * 1000);",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('startsAt', start.toISOString());",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('endsAt', end.toISOString());",
          "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('courtName')) {",
          "  pm.collectionVariables.set('courtName', 'P-' + Date.now().toString().slice(-6));",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:3000" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "Password1!" },
    { "key": "hostEmail", "value": "host.spot@example.com" },
    { "key": "joinerEmail", "value": "joiner.spot@example.com" },
    { "key": "hostPhone", "value": "0901000001" },
